<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you for contacting us about <b><i>-enter issue here-</i>.</b></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If policy applied correctly add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I regret you were unaware of this oneworld policy and were unhappy with the <b><i>-charge/outcome etc-</i></b>.&nbsp;I have investigated this matter and can confirm<b> <i>-the fee was applied correctly/our staff advised you correctly-</i></b>, so we are unable to meet your request for <b><i>-a refund/compensation-</i></b> on this occasion.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We do provide information about our<i> </i><b><i>-baggage/check-in/fees etc-</i> </b>policy on our website at <b><i>-insert hyperlink to relevant page of qantas.com-</i></b>. You may wish to check this next time you <i>-book/travel-</i>, so that you are better prepared.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If referring to oneworld airline add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want all of our customers to have a smooth journey, so were naturally concerned to hear about the inconvenience you encountered when you flew with our oneworld partner, {!Case.Airline__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">As your flight was operated by {!Case.Airline__c} you will need to contact them directly to discuss your experience. They can be contacted at<b> <i>-insert airline email or feedback form address</i>-.</b></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are grateful of you telling us about your own experience. Your comments have been passed onto the Qantas management team responsible for monitoring our arrangements with {!Case.Airline__c} for our own records.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">I am sure that the next time you fly with us, or any of our oneworld partners, you have a more enjoyable experience.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><p style=""><font size="2"><br></font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, sans-serif; color: white;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>